  ⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧         ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#cba6f7 bg=#2c2d3d bold⟧return⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧ []                                                          ⟦/⟧
  ⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧     ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#cba6f7 bg=#2c2d3d bold⟧return⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧ [(-b + s * math.sqrt(d)) / (⟦/⟧⟦fg=#fab387 bg=#2c2d3d⟧2⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧ * a) ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#cba6f7 bg=#2c2d3d bold⟧for⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧ s ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#cba6f7 bg=#2c2d3d bold⟧in⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧ (⟦/⟧⟦fg=#fab387 bg=#2c2d3d⟧1⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧, -⟦/⟧⟦fg=#fab387 bg=#2c2d3d⟧1⟦/⟧⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧)]            ⟦/⟧
  ⟦bg=#2c2d3d⟧                                                                            ⟦/⟧

