          ⟦fg=#6c7086⟧│⟦/⟧⟦bg=#272839⟧ ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#f38ba8 bg=#272839 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧\Delta = 0⟦/⟧⟦bg=#272839⟧ ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#6c7086⟧│⟦/⟧⟦bg=#272839⟧ 1 real    ⟦/⟧⟦fg=#6c7086⟧│⟦/⟧
